<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LENCO, LENVEST CAUTION ON TALKS.</title>
<headline>LENCO, LENVEST CAUTION ON TALKS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lenco Investment Holdings Ltd and Lenco Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday talks were in progress which could impact on both their share prices.</p>
<p>Shareholders were urged to exercise caution until a further announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
